1
00:01:58,179 --> 00:01:59,440
This turned out great.

2
00:02:04,862 --> 00:02:07,342
He can have a snack as soon as he gets home from school.

3
00:02:12,430 --> 00:02:16,365
That's strange... He's usually back long before now...

4
00:02:18,570 --> 00:02:20,054
I'm home...

5
00:02:20,078 --> 00:02:22,365
Welcome back... Huh?

6
00:02:23,540 --> 00:02:26,080
What happened? You're so filthy...

7
00:02:27,004 --> 00:02:35,800
Did you get into another fight with the bully and dilly-dally on the way home? Come on, take a seat... Grandpa put his heart into making today's treat.

8
00:02:40,514 --> 00:02:42,094
How is it? Is it good?

9
00:02:43,573 --> 00:02:44,573
It's delicious.

10
00:02:45,699 --> 00:02:46,880
Good, good.

11
00:02:47,099 --> 00:02:49,519
Grandpa, am I a bad boy?

12
00:02:49,690 --> 00:02:51,513
Why would you ask such a thing?

13
00:02:51,825 --> 00:02:54,240
There is no way my Mokku could be a bad boy.

14
00:02:54,674 --> 00:02:57,362
But I got into a fight at school.

15
00:02:57,704 --> 00:03:00,760
If you fought because you believed it was right, then it couldn't be helped.

16
00:03:01,319 --> 00:03:04,694
I'm sure they were teasing you just because you're a wooden puppet.

17
00:03:05,286 --> 00:03:06,866
Mokku, come over here.

18
00:03:09,119 --> 00:03:12,799
Still, fighting isn't right. You have to try to get along with everyone.

19
00:03:13,260 --> 00:03:20,016
But they bully me... They call me a puppet monster and say I'm impudent for studying with humans when I'm just a puppet.

20
00:03:20,520 --> 00:03:27,060
Even though I just want to be friends with them... I don't want to go to school anymore. I just want to stay by your side forever, Grandpa.

21
00:03:27,937 --> 00:03:31,668
If it means you can become human, Grandpa will...

22
00:03:32,958 --> 00:03:35,058
But... I'll help with your work, Grandpa! Anything you need.

23
00:03:35,684 --> 00:03:37,260
I don't want to go to school!

24
00:03:37,614 --> 00:03:39,400
Mokku, that's no good.

25
00:03:39,584 --> 00:03:43,670
School is where you learn good manners and study so you can make friends with everyone.

26
00:03:43,939 --> 00:03:46,537
If you quit school now, they'll just pick on you even more.

27
00:03:46,880 --> 00:03:51,140
Don't worry. Before long, you'll make friends and look forward to going to school.

28
00:03:51,254 --> 00:03:52,800
You just have to be patient until then.

29
00:03:53,094 --> 00:03:55,539
Okay. I'll go to school, Grandpa.

30
00:03:56,587 --> 00:03:59,322
There's a good boy. So sensible.

31
00:04:00,489 --> 00:04:03,675
Now, eat plenty so you grow strong. Eat up!

32
00:04:27,400 --> 00:04:29,845
Now then, Mokku, watch this!

33
00:04:36,640 --> 00:04:38,276
You damn puppet!

34
00:04:45,636 --> 00:04:46,326
Mokku!

35
00:04:46,500 --> 00:04:47,987
Now go pick that up!

36
00:04:52,287 --> 00:04:54,222
Now then, let's begin class.

37
00:04:59,234 --> 00:05:01,414
W-Who did this?!

38
00:05:03,520 --> 00:05:05,990
Mokku did it! Right, everyone?

39
00:05:06,440 --> 00:05:10,000
Go on, tell him Mokku did it. Y-Yes, it was Mokku.

40
00:05:10,270 --> 00:05:11,700
Did Mokku really do this?

41
00:05:12,375 --> 00:05:13,560
Mokku isn't even here.

42
00:05:18,960 --> 00:05:20,837
Franco, I got the ball!

43
00:05:21,610 --> 00:05:23,120
Shut up. Get lost.

44
00:05:24,619 --> 00:05:25,510
Hey, Mokku!

45
00:05:25,535 --> 00:05:26,016


46
00:05:26,040 --> 00:05:28,298
Class has already started. What were you doing?

47
00:05:28,650 --> 00:05:32,131
Playing pranks and showing up late to class... You're a hopeless child.

48
00:05:32,580 --> 00:05:34,920
Stand there until I say so!

49
00:05:36,293 --> 00:05:38,293
Good-bye!

50
00:05:39,268 --> 00:05:43,900
Making excuses isn't manly. Just be good and do your best tomorrow.

51
00:05:45,120 --> 00:05:47,020
All right, you may go home for today.

52
00:05:47,970 --> 00:05:49,605
Goodbye, sir.

53
00:06:19,910 --> 00:06:21,629
You're Mokku, right?

54
00:06:22,530 --> 00:06:24,405
How do you know my name?

55
00:06:24,840 --> 00:06:27,820
I've known you ever since you were born.

56
00:06:28,615 --> 00:06:30,000
Huh, that long?

57
00:06:30,541 --> 00:06:34,140
Yes. I even know the teacher scolded you and made you stand today.

58
00:06:34,495 --> 00:06:38,284
Huh, even that? But that was because Franco and the others...

59
00:06:38,559 --> 00:06:42,312
I know that too. Mokku, I'm on your side.

60
00:06:42,760 --> 00:06:46,835
Why don't you quit a school with such bad friends? How about playing with me instead?

61
00:06:47,128 --> 00:06:48,683
I know a really fun place.

62
00:06:50,240 --> 00:06:52,611
I wonder what happened. He's late coming home...

63
00:06:54,542 --> 00:06:56,462
Oh, the clock has stopped.

64
00:06:59,229 --> 00:07:01,874
Have you gotten old, just like me?

65
00:07:02,484 --> 00:07:04,059
Come on, follow me.

66
00:07:04,732 --> 00:07:07,244
N-N-No way. Grandpa is waiting for me.

67
00:07:07,549 --> 00:07:08,714
Come on, let's go together.

68
00:07:08,739 --> 00:07:10,039
No, I can't.

69
00:07:10,235 --> 00:07:12,430
Mokku, it's a truly wonderful place.

70
00:07:14,550 --> 00:07:15,324
Fine, see if I care.

71
00:07:18,344 --> 00:07:19,344
Wait!

72
00:07:31,082 --> 00:07:32,113
Wait!

73
00:07:32,570 --> 00:07:35,080
Huh? Where did she go?

74
00:07:35,767 --> 00:07:37,173
Over here, Mokku!

75
00:07:43,529 --> 00:07:44,880
Wait!

76
00:07:52,108 --> 00:07:53,210


77
00:08:02,207 --> 00:08:03,403
Catch me if you can!

78
00:08:22,562 --> 00:08:24,710
Call me Kathy.

79
00:08:25,515 --> 00:08:26,546
Kathy... 

80
00:08:27,992 --> 00:08:30,120
...where is this fun place anyway?

81
00:08:30,740 --> 00:08:32,320
I'm getting tired.

82
00:08:32,425 --> 00:08:35,843
Just a little further. Come on, hang in there and keep up.

83
00:08:46,229 --> 00:08:47,320
I'm exhausted.

84
00:08:52,558 --> 00:08:54,645
<i>It's starting to get creepy around here.</i>

85
00:08:54,889 --> 00:08:57,140
<i>Mokku, hurry and come here.</i>

86
00:09:06,309 --> 00:09:08,400
Kathy, I want to go home.

87
00:09:08,920 --> 00:09:14,760
It's all right, Mokku. Open the door in front of you. A wonderful world is waiting for you on the other side.

88
00:09:15,861 --> 00:09:17,811
But there's no door here.

89
00:09:22,829 --> 00:09:24,226
Could this be it?

90
00:09:38,786 --> 00:09:39,541
Mokku.

91
00:09:42,319 --> 00:09:47,740
Mokku, you must not open that door. Don't you want to become human?

92
00:09:49,375 --> 00:09:51,800
T-The Oak Tree Fairy...

93
00:09:52,070 --> 00:09:53,660
You must not open that door.

94
00:09:54,139 --> 00:09:59,020
I'll always be just a wooden puppet! If that's the case, then turn me into a human already!

95
00:09:59,860 --> 00:10:07,440
That depends on your own efforts. You must not rely on others. You have to discover it with your own eyes, with your own heart.

96
00:10:09,370 --> 00:10:13,885
You always say things like that! You're never going to turn me into a human, are you?!

97
00:10:14,615 --> 00:10:18,010
Instead of that, I just want to have fun!

98
00:10:19,829 --> 00:10:22,464
Mokku! Don't! Opening that door—!

99
00:10:58,960 --> 00:11:00,460
Wow...

100
00:11:02,360 --> 00:11:04,480
That must be the wonderful place she was talking about.

101
00:11:04,800 --> 00:11:08,080
That's right. It's the most wonderful land in the world.

102
00:11:10,458 --> 00:11:14,200
For kids who are constantly hounded to study, it really is a dream paradise.

103
00:11:14,829 --> 00:11:18,460
 The most wonderful land in the world. A dream paradise.

104
00:11:19,039 --> 00:11:20,926
 Are you sure it's okay not to study?

105
00:11:30,756 --> 00:11:33,852
Well hey there, pretty girl. Are you riding in this carriage?

106
00:11:35,596 --> 00:11:38,475
Huh? It's a wooden puppet. You coming too?

107
00:11:39,296 --> 00:11:42,953
Heh, too bad there aren't any seats open for a puppet.

108
00:11:43,351 --> 00:11:45,684
Hey, you go up on the roof!

109
00:11:45,740 --> 00:11:48,297
What? The roof is full, too!

110
00:11:48,340 --> 00:11:50,229
Shut up! When I tell you to go, you go!

111
00:11:53,036 --> 00:11:54,602
Come on in, miss.

112
00:11:56,813 --> 00:12:00,062
She's quite a looker. Let's be friends.

113
00:12:01,507 --> 00:12:04,342
Get lost! There's no room for you here!

114
00:12:04,936 --> 00:12:08,596
I have no choice. I'll ride on Mr. Reindeer's back.

115
00:12:12,889 --> 00:12:16,898
Mokku, are you really going? Don't do it! You'll regret it!

116
00:12:17,514 --> 00:12:19,827
All right, let's head out!

117
00:12:26,506 --> 00:12:28,926
Ha-ha! You're gonna regret this later!

118
00:12:31,349 --> 00:12:36,620
Yo-ho-ho! Yo-ho-ho! Yo-ho-ho, yo-ho-ho!

119
00:12:41,379 --> 00:12:42,340
All together now!

120
00:12:42,341 --> 00:12:46,600
Let's go! Let's go to our own world!

121
00:12:47,340 --> 00:12:51,560
To a fun and joyful paradise!

122
00:12:52,480 --> 00:12:55,320
Goodbye to studying!

123
00:12:55,669 --> 00:13:05,460
There's no such thing as school! Let's go! Let's go! Forward, march!

124
00:13:10,320 --> 00:13:11,720
(Lyrics)

125
00:13:11,721 --> 00:13:14,180
(Lyrics)

126
00:13:16,660 --> 00:13:18,060
(Lyrics)

127
00:13:18,061 --> 00:13:19,061
(Lyrics)

128
00:14:07,559 --> 00:14:09,060
Yahoo!

129
00:14:09,849 --> 00:14:11,820
Yahoo!

130
00:14:15,070 --> 00:14:17,480
Mom, I don't need any textbooks!

131
00:14:17,577 --> 00:14:20,020
Ripping them up feels so good!

132
00:14:20,040 --> 00:14:22,360
Just tear up every single book!

133
00:14:26,489 --> 00:14:28,858
Awesome! Let's do it too!

134
00:14:42,327 --> 00:14:43,428
Good riddance.

135
00:14:58,585 --> 00:15:00,014
Attention!

136
00:15:08,930 --> 00:15:09,930
Here...

137
00:15:10,945 --> 00:15:13,300
He's just greeting you. Say hello, Mokku.

138
00:15:20,609 --> 00:15:26,580
Burn the books! It's a ritual to forget all about studying!

139
00:15:50,355 --> 00:15:51,498
So this is school, too.

140
00:15:51,522 --> 00:15:58,003
Now that the ritual is over, let's all head to school! School? It's a super fun school!

141
00:15:58,028 --> 00:16:02,220
That's right, let's go to our land!

142
00:16:02,221 --> 00:16:06,840
♪ A delightful, fun paradise

143
00:16:07,679 --> 00:16:10,140
♪ Say goodbye to studying

144
00:16:10,141 --> 00:16:13,580
♪ Who cares about school?

145
00:16:15,659 --> 00:16:17,720
♪ Let's go, let's go

146
00:16:17,721 --> 00:16:20,280
♪ March on, march on

147
00:16:20,979 --> 00:16:23,380
♪ Wonderful and cheerful

148
00:16:23,381 --> 00:16:29,180
♪ Off we go, students

149
00:16:36,686 --> 00:16:38,306
Hey, hurry up and do it!

150
00:16:38,640 --> 00:16:39,680
Yeah.

151
00:16:48,920 --> 00:16:54,334
Let's go! Let's go! Move it! Move it!

152
00:16:56,859 --> 00:16:58,400
This is the graffiti room.

153
00:16:59,245 --> 00:17:00,560
Here at this school, classes work like this:

154
00:17:00,859 --> 00:17:06,020
Mondays are off, and what's more, a week consists of six Sundays and a Monday.

155
00:17:07,532 --> 00:17:09,328
Then the whole week is time off!

156
00:17:10,137 --> 00:17:12,496
Yahoo!

157
00:17:13,009 --> 00:17:18,154
So vacation lasts from January 1st to December 31st.

158
00:17:19,959 --> 00:17:21,599
Then that's the whole year!

159
00:17:22,720 --> 00:17:34,229
Everything is backwards at this school. Study time is playtime. Any child who doesn't follow that gets scolded by the teacher. Now, go stu—no, go play in those lovely classrooms!

160
00:17:39,019 --> 00:17:43,840
Let's see, let's see... I wonder if there are any fun classrooms.

161
00:17:45,314 --> 00:17:48,544
Hey, Mokku! The science lab! This looks fun!

162
00:18:11,399 --> 00:18:12,977
Hey, Mokku! Come look!

163
00:18:14,384 --> 00:18:16,537
A mini-monster is being born!

164
00:18:41,356 --> 00:18:42,192
I hate this!

165
00:18:45,559 --> 00:18:46,473
Help!

166
00:19:00,469 --> 00:19:04,306
Help me, Mama, Papa!

167
00:19:22,799 --> 00:19:24,329
Kathy!

168
00:19:32,489 --> 00:19:38,295
Mokku, you know better than anyone that if you leave your parents and just fool around, you'll end up as nothing more than a piece of oak scrap.

169
00:19:45,020 --> 00:19:46,360
That oak is mine!

170
00:19:46,540 --> 00:19:47,633
Who in the world are you?

171
00:19:47,960 --> 00:19:49,760
I am the Poppy Fairy.

172
00:19:50,280 --> 00:19:51,624
The Poppy Fairy?

173
00:19:52,619 --> 00:19:55,141
That's right, I'm the Poppy Fairy.

174
00:19:55,689 --> 00:19:59,540
Like hell I'll let that Oak Fairy turn you into a human with her soft-hearted nonsense!

175
00:19:59,541 --> 00:20:00,580
I'll never let it happen!

176
00:20:01,440 --> 00:20:04,642
Besides, why don't you hurry up and turn back into a stick of wood!

177
00:20:09,620 --> 00:20:14,620
Sleep. Think of nothing, deeper and deeper, breathing in this scent of blood.

178
00:20:15,419 --> 00:20:19,840
Now, sleep. And you will be just an ordinary oak stick.

179
00:20:39,089 --> 00:20:43,028
Mokku, Mokku, you must not sleep.

180
00:20:44,260 --> 00:20:51,540
Mokku, wake up. Open your mind's eye as well. Keep your heart strong and true.

181
00:20:54,719 --> 00:21:01,566
Oak Tree Fairy... You blockhead, so you've shown yourself! I won't lose to the likes of you!

182
00:21:35,259 --> 00:21:37,720
Ah, is that the best you can do?!

183
00:22:36,582 --> 00:22:38,817
 Was I having a dream?

184
00:22:46,299 --> 00:22:48,720
 Look! The house is still there!

185
00:22:49,549 --> 00:22:51,161
 Grandpa is waiting for me!

186
00:22:57,351 --> 00:22:59,931
Grandpa!

187
00:23:06,449 --> 00:23:07,780
Grandpa, I'm home!

188
00:23:08,244 --> 00:23:11,900
Wh-What's the matter, Mokku? You're awfully full of energy. Huh?

189
00:23:13,579 --> 00:23:16,900
Grandpa, I'll be a good boy from now on. I'll go to school, too.

190
00:23:17,280 --> 00:23:18,569
I see, I see.

191
00:23:21,669 --> 00:23:22,762
Grandpa...

192
00:23:23,278 --> 00:23:24,185
Mokku...

193
00:23:24,780 --> 00:23:26,157
My dear Mokku.

194
00:23:33,739 --> 00:23:38,760
Using the magic ring in Oyakata's possession, Mokku is turned into a demon.

195
00:23:39,754 --> 00:23:42,260
A demon who does nothing but evil.

196
00:23:42,992 --> 00:23:47,820
On top of that, seeking to make a profit, Oyakata locks Grandfather away and forces him to make puppets.

197
00:23:49,220 --> 00:23:56,740
With the help of Giorgio, a kindhearted crow, will Mokku be able to regain his good heart and save Grandfather?

198
00:23:57,654 --> 00:24:00,400
<i>Look forward to next week's
Kashi no Ki Mokku!</i>

